Error [E0121]: `b` was consumed by `Box.unwrap`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/take_self_method.jet:10:13
    |
 10 |     print(b.n)
    |             ^
 Why: after a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: give away a copy instead (`~b`) where it moved
move site: source bytes 103..104; reuse site: source bytes 127..128; consuming callee: Box.unwrap
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
